```
Technical Details
The container using the data-radix-scroll-area-viewport attribute has a child div with an inline style of display: table. This prevents the internal table from triggering the horizontal scrollbar correctly.

The Fix
Changing the child div of the scroll viewport to display: block resolves the clipping and allows the table to be scrolled horizontally.

Suggested CSS fix:

CSS
[data-radix-scroll-area-viewport] > div {
    display: block !important;
}
Steps to Reproduce
Search for a game (e.g., Final Fantasy VII).

Open the download modal.

Observe that the "Actions" column is missing/clipped and no horizontal scrollbar is present.
```

